{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41631726\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述涉及PD神经环路病理及DBS治疗机制，可提供环路功能异常的背景，但未明确讨论STN神经活动与FOG的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41634613\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究的是非帕金森病相关的原发性进行性冻结步态，主要涉及顶叶萎缩，不涉及STN或PD相关FOG机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41637203\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD患者FOG及其干预效果，可提供FOG临床表型和皮层运动网络的交叉证据，但未记录STN活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41639440\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD中SCAN与STN等DBS靶点的功能连接及治疗相关神经变化，可提供STN参与全脑运动网络调控的理论和神经生理背景，但未明确分析FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41645156\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD-FOG与SMA及其脑网络连接的关系，可作为皮层网络竞争性机制的参考，但目前是试验方案且不涉及STN记录。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41646181\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论运动训练对PD的分子神经保护机制，与STN神经活动及FOG缺乏直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41654501\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接分析PD-FOG患者的神经活动特征，并包含两名患者的STN记录与动物模型结果比较，是研究STN神经活动与FOG关系的重要原始证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41657009\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要研究可穿戴传感器和深度学习算法检测FOG的泛化能力，不涉及脑神经活动或STN机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41657410\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD动物模型黑质星形胶质细胞和小胶质细胞蛋白质组学，与STN神经活动及FOG缺乏直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41659700\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"网络荟萃分析比较不同DBS方式对PD步态和FOG-Q的疗效，可提供STN-DBS相关临床结局的综合证据，帮助分析神经调控与FOG之间的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41659756\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论DBS专科培训和临床教育体系，不涉及STN神经生理机制或FOG研究。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41660343\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然病例患者术前存在FOG并接受STN-DBS，但研究重点是刺激诱发双侧运动障碍，未分析FOG变化或相关STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41686905\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过长期皮层和苍白球神经记录研究PD患者步行状态解码，可作为基底节神经活动与步态状态关系的交叉证据，但未涉及STN或FOG特异性分析。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41688232\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述TMS-EEG技术及其神经生理应用，没有针对PD-FOG或STN神经活动的具体证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41689277\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究晚期PD患者停止STN-DBS后的临床结局，涉及跌倒相关指标和运动功能变化，可间接提供STN刺激与轴性运动障碍关系的证据，但未明确分析FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41714177\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"利用静息态EEG识别PD-FOG患者，提供FOG相关神经电生理特征及皮层机制的交叉证据，但没有STN记录。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41718565\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较PD和脑小血管病相关FOG的PET代谢及多巴胺转运体特征，可帮助分析FOG的不同神经病理机制，但没有STN特异性神经活动数据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41725684\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究小鼠初级躯体感觉皮层不同频率电刺激的细胞反应，与PD、STN及FOG缺乏直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41738058\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述多系统萎缩的功能磁共振影像学标志物，并非PD-FOG或STN神经活动研究。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41738647\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论睡眠环路调控及动物到人体的转化，与研究问题无直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41741462\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"利用STN beta活动指导自适应DBS并报告步态改善，可直接提供STN神经振荡与步态调控的证据，但摘要未报告FOG特异性结局。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41743427\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述多种神经系统疾病的脑机接口康复应用，缺乏STN神经活动与PD-FOG关系的具体证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41749044\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要研究神经干细胞移植对PD动物模型运动功能的影响，不涉及STN神经活动或FOG机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41750227\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论PD药物治疗、药物递送和新型治疗靶点，与STN神经活动和FOG关系缺乏直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41752869\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述TMS对PD皮层兴奋性、突触可塑性及功能连接的影响，未针对STN与FOG关系展开讨论。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41757373\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论PD生物学诊断标准及病理生物标志物，不涉及STN神经活动与FOG的具体关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41760132\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究FOG发生前的beta频段皮层功能连接变化，可提供冻结前神经动态及皮层网络机制的证据，用于与STN主导机制进行比较，但未记录STN活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41772259\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"纵向研究FOG恶化过程中DLPFC、脑干中脑运动区及小脑之间的有效连接变化，可提供FOG进展和竞争性网络机制的证据，但未涉及STN直接记录。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41777619\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然研究对象接受了STN-DBS，但研究重点是腹部疼痛及异常运动，不涉及FOG或其相关STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41783853\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"专门综述PD-FOG的前额叶神经影像和认知机制，可用于构建与STN振荡异常相竞争的皮层网络解释，但不是STN特异性综述。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "468b5943-69fd-47df-a306-b92b9ef6d04e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T072153716299Z", "elapsed_seconds": 80.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T07:23:14.311713+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "83bb19d1fbab16d0a46c9cf0db5bee5941214eca35ba9b9552b34bd53b4fe202", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T072153716299Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c81dc771941ddd8fd6dcf6fe441dd29b85ce20d1057fb72f7e97e491c457d321"}}}
